{
 "id": "04e91207-ec17-488e-af2b-b6e0b4ad4ea8",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tada no mobunanoni, kōshaku-ka atotori no hogo-sha ni narimashite"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ただのモブなのに、侯爵家跡取りの保護者になりまして"
   },
   {
    "en": "Even though I was just a mob character, I ended up becoming the guardian of the heir to the Marquis family."
   },
   {
    "en": "From a background character to the guardian of the marquess's heir"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I was supposed to have died in an accident… but when I opened my eyes, I found myself inside the pages of my favorite novel!\nAnd the worst part? I wasn’t reborn as the heroine or even the villainess… but as a completely insignificant side character.\n\nAccording to the original story, the noble couple I work for will soon disappear, and all the servants will be dismissed afterward.\nI knew exactly how it was going to play out, so I told myself:\n“I’ll just live quietly, freely, and comfortably in my own way.”\n\nBut things didn’t go as planned…\n\nSuddenly, and completely against the original plot, I find myself in charge of the marquess’s children, who were left behind after the tragic accident.\nI’ve become their guardian, even though I was never meant to play this role!\n\nEven when I tried to walk away, I couldn’t ignore their innocent eyes and their need for comfort…\nSo I chose to take on the responsibility, leading them on a journey filled with surprises and challenges."
  },
